/// Tasks that belong to a todo list. Each task references its parent list
/// ({@link todo_app_lists.id}). Tasks are primary business entities with
/// lifecycle and completion metadata. Added optional priority field
/// (business enum: 'low','medium','high','urgent') to satisfy functional
/// requirements.
///
/// @namespace Todos
/// @author AutoBE - https://github.com/wrtnlabs/autobe
